Reverse(&amp;#34;racecar&amp;#34;) → &amp;#34;racecar&amp;#34;
&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;p>Tests are in &lt;code>solution_test.go&lt;/code>. Run &lt;code>check&lt;/code> or &lt;code>go test&lt;/code> to verify.&lt;/p>
